{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/aras-heights-aras-development-majan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":383,"crm_id":"1735","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Aras Heights","slug":"aras-heights-aras-development-majan","display_address":"Majan","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Aras Group","price":1000000,"display_price":"1M","lattitude":25.0893166,"longitude":55.3143724,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Aras Heights is a luxurious residential complex developed by Aras Development, located in the upscale Majan district of Dubai. The complex offers a high level of comfort and convenience thanks to the integration of smart home technology.</p><p>The futuristic style of the building is evident in its sleek lines and emphasis on geometric forms.</p><p>Aras Heights provides studios as well as <strong>One Two and Three bedroom</strong> residences. Every aspect of the complex has been carefully designed and integrated with smart technology to ensure maximum comfort and efficiency. The smart home system ensures security, remote control of lighting and climate, and monitoring of safety while away. Residents can always stay connected with their homes through the smart home system, providing them with the highest level of convenience and peace of mind.</p><p>Residents of Aras Heights have the opportunity to engage in sports, visit various shops, relax in restaurants and cafes, all without leaving the complex.</p><p>The convenient location of the complex in the Dubai area allows residents to access the main attractions of the city quickly. Within a 10-minute drive from the complex are the Park by MAG, Adventure Worlds, and Global Village. Dubai Outlet Mall and Hamdan Sports Complex are both within a 15-minute drive.</p>","tile_image":